---
title: Owner sign-up, email confirmation and workshop onboarding
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Owner
  participant App as Next.js app
  participant Auth as Supabase Auth
  participant Mail as Email inbox
  participant DB as Postgres

  Owner->>App: Register (name, phone, email, password)
  App->>App: Validate with Zod (8+ chars, letters and numbers)
  App->>Auth: signUp() with emailRedirectTo /auth/callback?next=/onboarding
  Auth->>DB: Insert auth user
  DB->>DB: Trigger creates profiles row (name, phone, email)
  Auth->>Mail: Confirmation link
  App-->>Owner: "We sent a confirmation link"
  Owner->>Auth: Opens the link (same device)
  Auth-->>Owner: Redirect to /auth/callback?code=…
  Owner->>App: GET /auth/callback
  App->>Auth: exchangeCodeForSession(code) using the PKCE cookie
  App-->>Owner: Session cookie set, redirect to /onboarding
  Owner->>App: Workshop details (Pakistan defaults: PKR, Asia/Karachi)
  App->>DB: rpc create_workshop()
  Note over DB: One transaction: workshop + owner membership + activity log entry
  App-->>Owner: active_workshop cookie, redirect to /dashboard
